#: src/mintmotion:96
msgid "Fill the screen (crops the excess)"
msgstr "填满屏幕（裁掉多余部分）"

#: src/mintmotion:97
msgid "Fit without cropping (black bars)"
msgstr "完整适应（留黑边）"

#: src/mintmotion:98
msgid "Stretch (may distort)"
msgstr "拉伸（可能变形）"

#: src/mintmotion:99
msgid "High (recommended)"
msgstr "高（推荐）"

#: src/mintmotion:100
msgid "Maximum (more work for the GPU)"
msgstr "最高（GPU 负担更大）"

#: src/mintmotion:101
msgid "Saver (basic scaling)"
msgstr "节能（基础缩放）"

#: src/mintmotion:104
msgid "playing"
msgstr "播放中"

#: src/mintmotion:104
msgid "paused"
msgstr "已暂停"

#: src/mintmotion:104
msgid "sleeping"
msgstr "休眠中"

#: src/mintmotion:105
msgid "error"
msgstr "错误"

#: src/mintmotion:105
msgid "stopped"
msgstr "已停止"

#: src/mintmotion:553
msgid "Video as desktop background"
msgstr "将视频设为桌面背景"

#: src/mintmotion:576
msgid "Choose video…"
msgstr "选择视频…"

#: src/mintmotion:587
msgid "Optimize for my screen"
msgstr "为我的屏幕优化"

#: src/mintmotion:589
msgid "Creates a copy of the video at the exact resolution of your screen, at 30 fps at most and without sound: maximum sharpness and minimum resource usage. The original is not touched."
msgstr "按屏幕的精确分辨率生成视频副本，最高 30 帧/秒，不含声音：画面最清晰，资源占用最低。原视频不会被修改。"

#: src/mintmotion:594
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

#: src/mintmotion:612
msgid "Screen fit"
msgstr "屏幕适应方式"

#: src/mintmotion:613
msgid "Scaling quality"
msgstr "缩放质量"

#: src/mintmotion:614
msgid "Pause when the desktop is fully covered"
msgstr "桌面被完全遮挡时暂停"

#: src/mintmotion:615
msgid "Hardware decoding"
msgstr "硬件解码"

#: src/mintmotion:629
msgid "Resource usage of MintMotion (the mpv player) compared with the whole computer. The work Cinnamon does to show the video happens inside Cinnamon and cannot be separated, so it is not included."
msgstr "MintMotion（mpv 播放器）的资源占用与整台电脑的对比。Cinnamon 显示视频所做的工作发生在 Cinnamon 内部，无法单独统计，因此不包括在内。"

#: src/mintmotion:658
msgid "Uninstall…"
msgstr "卸载…"

#: src/mintmotion:661
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Removes {app} and all its settings from the computer. Your videos are not touched."
msgstr "从电脑中移除 {app} 及其全部设置。不会动你的视频。"

#: src/mintmotion:664
msgid "Remove video"
msgstr "移除视频"

#: src/mintmotion:666
msgid "Stops playing the video and goes back to your static desktop background."
msgstr "停止播放视频，恢复为静态桌面背景。"

#: src/mintmotion:668
msgid "Apply"
msgstr "应用"

#: src/mintmotion:670
msgid "Sets the video as background with these options."
msgstr "按这些选项将视频设为背景。"

#: src/mintmotion:680
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{app} · by {author}"
msgstr "{app} · 作者 {author}"

#: src/mintmotion:709
msgid "You are in a Wayland session. The video background only works in the X11 session of Cinnamon (the default one in Linux Mint and LMDE)."
msgstr "当前是 Wayland 会话。视频背景只能在 Cinnamon 的 X11 会话中使用（Linux Mint 和 LMDE 的默认会话）。"

#: src/mintmotion:713
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{app} needs the Cinnamon desktop."
msgstr "{app} 需要 Cinnamon 桌面。"

#: src/mintmotion:715
msgid "mpv is missing: install it with “sudo apt install mpv”."
msgstr "缺少 mpv：请用“sudo apt install mpv”安装。"

#: src/mintmotion:753
msgid "_Close"
msgstr "关闭(_C)"

#: src/mintmotion:764
msgid "No video selected"
msgstr "未选择视频"

#: src/mintmotion:772
msgid "The file no longer exists."
msgstr "文件已不存在。"

#: src/mintmotion:783
msgid "Not recognized as a video."
msgstr "无法识别为视频。"

#: src/mintmotion:802
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Ideal for your screen ({w}×{h})."
msgstr "非常适合你的屏幕（{w}×{h}）。"

#: src/mintmotion:807
#, python-brace-format
msgid "your screen is {w}×{h}"
msgstr "你的屏幕是 {w}×{h}"

#: src/mintmotion:809
msgid "more than 30 fps costs more without being noticeable in a background"
msgstr "超过 30 帧/秒会更耗资源，而作为背景看不出区别"

#: src/mintmotion:811
msgid "H.264 is the format that any graphics card decodes best"
msgstr "H.264 是所有显卡都解码得最好的格式"

#: src/mintmotion:812
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Can be optimized: {reasons}."
msgstr "可以优化：{reasons}。"

#: src/mintmotion:837
msgid "Choose a video"
msgstr "选择视频"

#: src/mintmotion:839 src/mintmotion:902 src/mintmotion:908 src/mintmotion:938
msgid "_Cancel"
msgstr "取消(_C)"

#: src/mintmotion:839 src/mintmotion:908
msgid "_Open"
msgstr "打开(_O)"

#: src/mintmotion:842
msgid "Videos"
msgstr "视频"

#: src/mintmotion:849
msgid "All files"
msgstr "所有文件"

#: src/mintmotion:887
msgid "Cinnamon was not found."
msgstr "未找到 Cinnamon。"

#: src/mintmotion:888
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{app} works as an extension of the Cinnamon desktop."
msgstr "{app} 以 Cinnamon 桌面扩展的形式运行。"

#: src/mintmotion:900
msgid "Your previous desktop background no longer exists"
msgstr "之前的桌面背景已不存在"

#: src/mintmotion:901
msgid "Choose an image to set as desktop background."
msgstr "请选择一张图片作为桌面背景。"

#: src/mintmotion:903
msgid "_Choose image…"
msgstr "选择图片(_C)…"

#: src/mintmotion:906
msgid "Choose a background image"
msgstr "选择背景图片"

#: src/mintmotion:910
msgid "Images"
msgstr "图片"

#: src/mintmotion:934
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Uninstall {app}?"
msgstr "要卸载 {app} 吗？"

#: src/mintmotion:935
msgid "The program, its Cinnamon extension and all its settings will be removed. The desktop will go back to a static background."
msgstr "将移除本程序、其 Cinnamon 扩展及全部设置。桌面会恢复为静态背景。"

#: src/mintmotion:937
msgid "Your videos will not be touched."
msgstr "不会动你的视频。"

#: src/mintmotion:939
msgid "_Uninstall"
msgstr "卸载(_U)"

#: src/mintmotion:944
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{app} is not installed as a package"
msgstr "{app} 不是以软件包形式安装的"

#: src/mintmotion:945
msgid "It seems to be installed from the source code. Uninstall it from that folder with:"
msgstr "它似乎是从源代码安装的。请在该文件夹中运行以下命令卸载："

#: src/mintmotion:949
msgid "pkexec is missing"
msgstr "缺少 pkexec"

#: src/mintmotion:950
msgid "Without pkexec I cannot ask for your password. Uninstall it from a terminal with:"
msgstr "没有 pkexec 就无法请求你的密码。请在终端中运行以下命令卸载："

#: src/mintmotion:960
#, python-brace-format
msgid "What should I do with the videos that {app} created?"
msgstr "如何处理 {app} 生成的视频？"

#: src/mintmotion:961
#, python-brace-format
msgid "“Optimize for my screen” created <b>{n} video</b> ({size}) in"
msgid_plural "“Optimize for my screen” created <b>{n} videos</b> ({size}) in"
msgstr[0] "“为我的屏幕优化”生成了 <b>{n} 个视频</b>（{size}），位于"

#: src/mintmotion:965
msgid "_Keep them"
msgstr "保留(_K)"

#: src/mintmotion:966
msgid "_Delete them"
msgstr "删除(_D)"

#: src/mintmotion:976
msgid "Uninstalling… enter your password if asked."
msgstr "正在卸载… 如有提示请输入密码。"

#: src/mintmotion:995
msgid "You cancelled the password prompt."
msgstr "你取消了密码输入。"

#: src/mintmotion:1004
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The optimized videos are still in {folder}."
msgstr "优化后的视频仍在 {folder}。"

#: src/mintmotion:1006
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{app} has been uninstalled"
msgstr "{app} 已卸载"

#: src/mintmotion:1007
msgid "Nothing of the program remains on the computer."
msgstr "电脑上已没有本程序的任何残留。"

#: src/mintmotion:1013
msgid "It was not uninstalled"
msgstr "未能卸载"

#: src/mintmotion:1024
msgid "No video: your static desktop background is shown."
msgstr "无视频：显示的是静态桌面背景。"

#: src/mintmotion:1026
msgid "Playing on the desktop."
msgstr "正在桌面上播放。"

#: src/mintmotion:1029
msgid "Paused: the desktop is covered (it barely uses CPU)."
msgstr "已暂停：桌面被遮挡（几乎不占用 CPU）。"

#: src/mintmotion:1032
msgid "Sleeping: the desktop has been covered for a while and the player was closed to free its memory. When uncovered, it continues where it was."
msgstr "休眠中：桌面已被遮挡一段时间，播放器已关闭以释放内存。桌面重新露出后会从原来的位置继续播放。"

#: src/mintmotion:1036
msgid "The player has failed several times (check ~/.xsession-errors)."
msgstr "播放器已多次出错（请查看 ~/.xsession-errors）。"

#: src/mintmotion:1039
msgid "Starting… (if this does not change, check ~/.xsession-errors)"
msgstr "正在启动…（如果一直如此，请查看 ~/.xsession-errors）"

#: src/mintmotion:1042
msgid "There are changes not applied yet: press “Apply”."
msgstr "有尚未应用的更改：请点击“应用”。"

#: src/mintmotion:1044
msgid "Press “Apply” to set the video."
msgstr "点击“应用”即可设置视频。"

#: src/mintmotion:1060
msgid "measuring…"
msgstr "测量中…"

#: src/mintmotion:1066
#, no-python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "{total}% of total · {core}% of one core ({n} core)"
msgid_plural "{total}% of total · {core}% of one core ({n} cores)"
msgstr[0] "占总量 {total}% · 占单核 {core}%（共 {n} 核）"

#: src/mintmotion:1072
#, no-python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "{used} of {total} · {pct}%"
msgstr "{used} / {total} · {pct}%"

#: src/mintmotion:1095 src/mintmotion:1111
#, no-python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "Optimizing… {pct}%"
msgstr "正在优化… {pct}%"

#: src/mintmotion:1128
msgid "The video could not be optimized."
msgstr "无法优化该视频。"

#: src/mintmotion:1161
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{app}: video as desktop background in Cinnamon. Without arguments it opens the settings window."
msgstr "{app}：在 Cinnamon 中将视频设为桌面背景。不带参数时打开设置窗口。"

#: src/mintmotion:1163
msgid "video to use as background (it also enables it)"
msgstr "用作背景的视频（同时启用）"

#: src/mintmotion:1164
msgid "screen fit"
msgstr "屏幕适应方式"

#: src/mintmotion:1165
msgid "scaling quality"
msgstr "缩放质量"

#: src/mintmotion:1167
msgid "pause when the desktop is covered"
msgstr "桌面被遮挡时暂停"

#: src/mintmotion:1168
msgid "hardware decoding"
msgstr "硬件解码"

#: src/mintmotion:1169
msgid "set the video as background"
msgstr "将视频设为背景"

#: src/mintmotion:1170
msgid "remove the video background"
msgstr "移除视频背景"

#: src/mintmotion:1171
msgid "show the status"
msgstr "显示状态"

#: src/mintmotion:1178
#, python-brace-format
msgid "could not migrate the previous version: {error}"
msgstr "无法迁移旧版本：{error}"

#: src/mintmotion:1190
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Does not exist: {path}"
msgstr "不存在：{path}"

#: src/mintmotion:1211
msgid "Cinnamon was not found (org.cinnamon schema)."
msgstr "未找到 Cinnamon（org.cinnamon 架构）。"

#: src/mintmotion:1214
msgid "yes"
msgstr "是"

#: src/mintmotion:1214
msgid "no"
msgstr "否"

#: src/mintmotion:1216
#, python-brace-format
msgid "enabled: {value}"
msgstr "已启用：{value}"

#: src/mintmotion:1217
#, python-brace-format
msgid "video: {value}"
msgstr "视频：{value}"

#: src/mintmotion:1217
msgid "(none)"
msgstr "（无）"

#: src/mintmotion:1218
#, python-brace-format
msgid "fit: {fit} · quality: {quality} · hardware: {hw} · pause when covered: {pause}"
msgstr "适应：{fit} · 质量：{quality} · 硬件解码：{hw} · 遮挡时暂停：{pause}"

#: src/mintmotion:1221
#, python-brace-format
msgid "state: {value}"
msgstr "状态：{value}"
